			]
			title: "Element 122"
			x: 20.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5EB2A04DCE181C6C"]
			description: ["Collide uranium on curium and the two swap nucleons, leaving neutron-rich nuclei near the island of stability. Weigh them by flight time and the &6Island Chart&r comes out."]
			icon: "grindless:island_chart"
			id: "3B31B6CA6A29B354"
			rewards: [{ id: "3B8DD8A719BD7BB3", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "53E99955377898FD", item: "grindless:island_nuclide", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7DA854D50204BB5F", item: "grindless:island_chart", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Island Chart"
			x: 22.5d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["78B28FCF40BA6381"]
			description: ["Back at Cygnus X-1 the black hole already pulls its companion apart. The stellar elevator heats the surface where the pull is strongest and catches the stream as &6Stellar Plasma&r. It works here and nowhere else."]
			icon: "gtceu:stellar_plasma_bucket"
			id: "195AB2A8BFFE1A97"
			rewards: [{ id: "388598F7D415F760", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5046C0D10A438081", item: "gtceu:stellar_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Lift the Star"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["195AB2A8BFFE1A97"]
			description: ["A spinning plasma flings its heavy ions outward. The plasma mass filter cuts the star into hydrogen, helium, carbon-nitrogen-oxygen and heavy cuts. Take the &6Stellar CNO Cut&r home for the Mk6 and send the heavy one to the condensation tower."]
			icon: "gtceu:stellar_cno_cut_bucket"
			id: "1D6EA5E7B47D1D45"
			rewards: [{ id: "7D1448966778CAF0", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1C88E209F77FF225", item: "gtceu:stellar_cno_cut_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Stellar Cuts"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1D6EA5E7B47D1D45"]
			description: ["The gas falling into the hole spins in a disk hot enough to glow in X-rays. The accretion disk skimmer takes its edge, and the mass filter turns the catch into &6Filtered Disk Plasma&r."]
			icon: "gtceu:filtered_disk_plasma_bucket"
			id: "1F3DBB6C9063CBDB"
			rewards: [{ id: "12FE5E79478614E4", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "389537BC8CAD930A", item: "gtceu:filtered_disk_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Skim the Disk"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F3DBB6C9063CBDB"]
			description: [
				"A field-reversed configuration is a smoke ring of plasma that holds its own field. The FRC former shoots one into a &6FRC Cartridge&r and keeps it there. Vela travel needs one, and so does the gate."
				"FRCs are real; one that sits in a cartridge until you need it is fiction."
			]
			icon: "grindless:frc_cartridge"
			id: "3A4C403FED5649E0"
			rewards: [{ id: "5FC5D87A2989C502", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5201D12D70F5B07A", item: "grindless:frc_cartridge", type: "item" }]
			title: "FRC Cartridge"
			x: 12.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3A4C403FED5649E0"]
			description: [
				"Swing a relay seed through the ergosphere and it leaves with some of the hole's spin. The ergosphere probe bay launches it as a &6Launched Relay Seed&r. The laser sail on the Moon launches the same seed, and either one opens the way."
				"The sling is fiction: nothing survives that close a pass, and no seed is this fast."
			]
			icon: "grindless:launched_relay_seed"
			id: "5D9EECDCAB8F0156"
			rewards: [{ id: "7E5A2171BC288563", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "7B7F5A1A5F192B01", item: "grindless:launched_relay_seed", type: "item" }]
			title: "The Kerr Sling"
			x: 15.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5D9EECDCAB8F0156"]
			description: [
				"A thin bumper in front of a wall breaks up whatever hits it, so the wall only meets a spray. The &6CNT Whipple Shield&r carries a seed through the dust of a supernova remnant."
				"Whipple shields are real; one that survives that crossing at that speed is fiction."
			]
			icon: "grindless:cnt_whipple_shield"
			id: "58EDB9BA0BF842AF"
			rewards: [{ id: "1B3C125E0A4A0819", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "74777C367B47A23F", item: "grindless:cnt_whipple_shield", type: "item" }]
			title: "Whipple Shield"
			x: 17.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5D9EECDCAB8F0156"]
			description: [
				"The first jump. The ring at Cygnus X-1 holds a launched seed and an FRC cartridge, and when the hold completes a platform appears at the Vela pulsar, a neutron star that spins eleven times a second and now and then speeds up."
				"The ring's output bus gets the platform's &6Relay Coordinates&r. Put them in the input bus of a ring that is holding and stand inside to ride there; step out of the platform's ring and back in to come home."
				"The jump is fiction, as every jump is. The pulsar and its glitches are real."
			]
			icon: "grindless:vela_glitch_timing"
			id: "586BAF51DA2477E3"
			rewards: [{ id: "5B4704B46BA18FC8", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			tasks: [{ dimension: "grindless:vela_pulsar_orbit", id: "3E86065FBFD39A5F", type: "dimension" }]
			title: "Vela Pulsar"
			x: 17.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["586BAF51DA2477E3"]
			description: ["Deep in a neutron star's crust the nuclei melt into rods, sheets and holes that physicists call pasta. A glitch shakes the crust loose; the pasta extractor times it and grows &6Raw Pasta&r from a neutronium pellet."]
			icon: "grindless:raw_pasta"
			id: "33D08C69A1A4AF87"
			rewards: [{ id: "1FE208E9444ADFE1", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "7A3E936C23703BE1", item: "grindless:raw_pasta", type: "item" }]
			title: "Raw Pasta"
			x: 20.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33D08C69A1A4AF87"]
			description: ["The pasta phase sorter separates the rods from the sheets inside a cage that keeps each one squeezed. You get &6Spaghetti Phase&r and &6Lasagna Phase&r, and the anti-phase residue goes to the core sample the gate keeps."]
			icon: "grindless:lasagna_phase"
			id: "1367407C3410944C"
			rewards: [{ id: "798A29CB0DCE6D99", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "17E73682D97568C8", item: "grindless:spaghetti_phase", type: "item" }
				{ id: "71334617363E174F", item: "grindless:lasagna_phase", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Caged Phases"
			x: 22.5d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1367407C3410944C"]
			description: ["The draw bench pulls spaghetti into wire and the laminator presses lasagna into plate: the UXV cable and the UXV hull. Outside a neutron star both would fly apart at once. That is fiction; the crust is real."]
			icon: "gtceu:pasta_strand_single_wire"
			id: "3E5A5DB9F7B862E9"
			rewards: [{ id: "133CD5D55ADB2612", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "79E42C5D98AB437F", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Pasta as Cable"
			x: 25.0d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["58EDB9BA0BF842AF"]
			description: ["The second jump: the Cygnus ring holds a launched seed behind a Whipple shield, and when the hold completes a platform appears among the ejecta of one of the youngest supernova remnants in the galaxy. Ride its &6Relay Coordinates&r there as before. The jump is fiction; the remnant is real."]
			icon: "grindless:ejecta_knot_dust"
			id: "5A539FCEC01451BA"
			rewards: [{ id: "114ED1E43E3AC5FC", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			tasks: [{ dimension: "grindless:cas_a_remnant", id: "30A986BDE2DD3F5F", type: "dimension" }]
			title: "Cassiopeia A"
			x: 20.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5A539FCEC01451BA"]
			description: ["The star's core was thrown out in clumps still rich in what it made as it died. The ejecta knot sweeper gathers &6Ejecta Knot Dust&r, and the X-ray pulse profiler maps its titanium-44."]
			icon: "grindless:ejecta_knot_dust"
			id: "74AAE7464DB346C0"
			rewards: [{ id: "14C7498610F3B608", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3E0AC299C40CEA39", item: "grindless:ejecta_knot_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Knot Dust"
			x: 22.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74AAE7464DB346C0"]
			description: ["Titanium-44 decays into a positron emitter and lives for decades. The cascade and the calutron take it out of the dust, and the hot cell seals it into a &6Ti-44 Core&r."]
			icon: "grindless:ti44_core"
			id: "17623833C3E320FE"
			rewards: [{ id: "783547992C6C3D7D", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5FA00BF1D3337E18", item: "grindless:ti44_core", type: "item" }]
			title: "Titanium-44 Core"
			x: 25.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17623833C3E320FE", "1367407C3410944C"]
			description: [
				"The Matrioshka computing array puts the elevator log, the Vela glitch record, the titanium-44 map and the Cygnus radio record together into the &6Arm Chart&r: our arm of the galaxy, mapped toward the centre."
				"The glitch record is read on Ganymede, where the gravitational-wave array listens against the Vela glitch timing the observatory decodes."
			]
			icon: "grindless:arm_chart"
			id: "1351A1703766CFB3"
			rewards: [{ id: "58C44B087C376411", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5F17D96620A152C3", item: "grindless:arm_chart", type: "item" }]
			title: "Arm Chart"
			x: 27.5d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1351A1703766CFB3"]
			description: [
				"Hold the warp gate open at the full UXV load for sixty seconds in Cygnus X-1 orbit, then tick this box. Plan your power first: a BZ dynamo and two polar cap taps come close, and a charged UXV cell covers the rest."
				"The gate burns an FRC cartridge and keeps census III, the island chart, the arm chart, a pasta core sample and UXV-tier circuits in its store."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:warp_gate"
			id: "5B7D80D05C71F861"
			rewards: [ ]
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "33EF140B320839EC", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Open the Bulge Gate"
			x: 30.0d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B7D80D05C71F861"]
			description: ["Through the open gate the seed looks at the crowded centre of the galaxy. The run gives the &6Bulge Chart&r."]
			icon: "grindless:bulge_chart"
			id: "12FAC9CC1F7D8215"
