		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1351A1703766CFB3"]
			description: ["The &6Gravitational Wave Detector&r, &6Deep Space Network&r, &6Event Horizon Interferometer&r and &6X-Ray Pulse Profiler&r each take a row that writes one record, and the &6Matrioshka Computer&r joins the four into the arm chart. The controllers from LuV to UIV, and samples from Vela and Cassiopeia A. The arm chart and, with it, the gate to OpV. Records are data orbs: hand them to the computer through a bus."]
			icon: "gtceu:matrioshka_computer"
			id: "1D61298813416D07"
