		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77ECA9A3DDFB480D"]
			description: ["The &6MTJ Sputter Cluster&r lays magnetic layers a few atoms thick, with a magnesia barrier between them that nothing older can deposit. A UIV hull, the plascrete shell and the magnetron parts, with sputter targets from the melter. The magnetic tunnel junction die, and through it the MRAM wafer and the racetrack chip. Targets and silicon-28 by ME; the dies come out in a chest."]
			icon: "gtceu:mtj_sputter_cluster"
			id: "1595ABB6AB097B3E"
			rewards: [{ id: "1835656A2A02BB85", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
