			description: ["The &6SrRuO3 Electrode Wafer&r is a wafer stage on the way to the BFO Film Wafer. Made in the &6Pulsed Laser Deposition&r from the Srruo3 Target and Dysco3 Substrate, with oxygen, in the cleanroom. The BFO Film Wafer and BFO Fume in the Pulsed Laser Deposition. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
